# seen Leon). Not a bug of the prototype: a port feature of the mods (runtime/finisher.cpp, a mod pack's melee/finish.dat
# with stealth finishers, kind 4).
# em10.cpp em10_R0_Move: after the routine of the Ganado's normal life, re4_stealth_prompt may show the "execute"
# prompt behind him; its action hands him the finishers' Dm_NeckBreak (patch 0921) with a stealth finisher.
# em10.cpp em10FindCk: the "very near" (3.5 m) and footstep (5 m) rules of the sight check are left out while
# re4_stealth_unheard says Leon walks behind him with a stealth kill at hand (running he is heard as before; in front
# of him he is seen as before). Declared in re4_whole_prelude.h.
# Nachtrag (device video of DevJunior, 19.11.2026 11:40: walking up behind a villager she still turned and attacked):
# FREE_EM10 Pl_rot is the angle to the next point of the route towards Leon (RouteCkToPos), which can lie in front of
# the Ganado while Leon is behind him; the sight rule (Pl_rot under 60 degrees, up to 15 m) is now left out too while
# re4_stealth_unheard says so, and re4_stealth_unheard measures the angle straight from where he faces to Leon.
